      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each grid level to step onto and complete all goal cells. A goal cell can only be completed when the currently carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the same time; once all goals in the level are completed, you advance to the next level, and completing all levels wins the game.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "You move one tile per turn (north/south/east/west), but must never choose a direction listed in blocked_directions because walls prevent movement. Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina reaches 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape tiles cycle shape 0\u20135 (wrap), color tiles cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange (wrap), and rotation tiles rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise through 0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920. A goal activates only when shape+color+rotation all match its requirement, and stepping onto an activated goal completes it."
      }
